                        <L-2 L="EN">A Reference to DemEventParameter element which shall be invoked using the API Dem_SetEventStatus in case CANTP_E_CANTPNAS_TIMEOUT_OCCURRED error occurs. The EventId is taken from the referenced DemEventParameter's DemEventId symbolic value.</L-2>
